    "preamble": "R.Velavan vs Dr.M.Jagadish Chandra Bose on 24 July, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Cont.P.N In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 24.07.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Cont.P.No.1914 of 2024 R.Velavan ... Petitio Vs. Dr.M.Jagadish Chandra Bose, Designated Officer, Food Safety Department, Ii Floor, Collectorate Main Complex, Thiruvallur District. ... Respond Prayer:- Contempt petition has been filed under Section 11 of the Co of Courts Act, 1971, praying to punish the respondent herein for the disobedience in not implementing the order made in W.M.P.No.15132 of 2024 in W.P.No.13938 of 2024 dated 22.05.2024.",
